{"t":"LYB","made":"2026-11-11 10:29","name":"LyondellBasell Industries N.V.","ko":null,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","employees":18970,"hq":"Rotterdam, Netherlands","website":"https://www.lyondellbasell.com","summary_en":"LyondellBasell Industries N.V. operates as a chemical company in the United States, Germany, China, Mexico, Italy, Japan, France, Poland, the Netherlands, and internationally. It operates in five segments: Olefins and PolyolefinsAmericas; Olefins and PolyolefinsEurope, Asia, International; Intermediates and Derivatives; Advanced Polymer Solutions; and Technology. The company produces and markets olefins and co-products, such as ethylene, aromatics, propylene and butadiene; polyolefins; polyethylene; polypropylene homopolymers and copolymers; propylene oxide and derivatives; oxyfuels and related products; and intermediate chemicals, such as styrene monomer and acetyls. It also produces and markets compounding and solutions, including polypropylene compounds, engineered plastics, masterbatches, and engineered composites and colors. In addition, it develops and licenses chemical and polyolefin process technologies; and manufactures and sells polyolefin catalysts and serves food packaging, home furnishings, automotive components, and paints and coatings applications. LyondellBasell Industries N.V. was incorporated in 2009 and is headquartered in Rotterdam, the Netherlands.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"LyondellBasell Industries N.V.는 미국, 독일, 중국, 멕시코, 이탈리아, 일본, 프랑스, ​​폴란드, 네덜란드 및 국제적으로 화학 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 올레핀 및 폴리올레핀, 아메리카 등 5개 부문으로 운영됩니다. 올레핀 및 폴리올레핀유럽, 아시아, 국제; 중간체 및 파생상품 고급 폴리머 솔루션; 및 기술. 이 회사는 에틸렌, 방향족 화합물, 프로필렌 및 ​​부타디엔과 같은 올레핀 및 부산물을 생산 및 판매합니다. 폴리올레핀; 폴리에틸렌; 폴리프로필렌 단독중합체 및 공중합체; 프로필렌 옥사이드 및 유도체; 산소연료 및 관련 제품; 스티렌 모노머 및 아세틸과 같은 중간 화학 물질. 또한 폴리프로필렌 화합물, 엔지니어링 플라스틱, 마스터배치, 엔지니어링 복합재 및 색상을 포함한 컴파운딩 및 솔루션을 생산하고 판매합니다. 또한 화학 및 폴리올레핀 공정 기술을 개발하고 라이센스합니다. 폴리올레핀 촉매를 제조 및 판매하고 식품 포장, 가정용 가구, 자동차 부품, 페인트 및 코팅 응용 분야를 제공합니다. LyondellBasell Industries N.V.는 2009년에 설립되었으며 네덜란드 로테르담에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":60.6,"mcap":19588495360.0,"pe":14.673122,"fpe":9.480453,"peg":null,"ps":0.6128299,"pb":1.740829,"ev_ebitda":7.134,"div":4.64,"beta":0.319,"hi52":83.94,"lo52":42.01},"fin":{"rev":31964000256.0,"rev_g":0.1,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.14563,"op":0.13402,"net":0.040510003,"roe":0.12182,"fcf":1778625024.0,"cash":3254000128.0,"debt":13710999552.0,"de":120.547,"eps":4.13,"feps":6.3921},"own":{"short":0.044699997,"inst":0.75935996,"insider":0.198},"analyst":{"n":18,"mean":72.27778,"median":72.0,"high":93.0,"low":58.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.85,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":2,"hold":11,"sell":2,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":2,"hold":12,"sell":2,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":2,"hold":10,"sell":2,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":4,"buy":3,"hold":8,"sell":2,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":74.0,"priorPriceTarget":63.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":69.0,"priorPriceTarget":62.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":69.0,"priorPriceTarget":66.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":82.0,"priorPriceTarget":68.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":76.0,"priorPriceTarget":70.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-13","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outp